Notes
  min NN is a guaranteed floor for Poisson-disk; CVT imposes none.
  CV is the metric CVT minimises, so compare it directly.
  resolution is what limits how well a charge can be positioned.
  cond is the quadratic term the optimiser sees; lower is better.
  cond depends on the smallest eigenvalue and so is sensitive to a
  few near-degenerate pairs. The pairs<0.8A / pairs<1.0A counts are
  the robust companions: quote those alongside it, not cond alone.

